      "content": "Honored to be part of the OpenAI Frontier Builders campaign. \n\nIt feels like just yesterday I was at the photoshoot, standing on a one-ton rock for a billboard in SF.\n\nThe campaign features founders who are building the future with AI. \n\nOpenAI chose the rock to represent one of the core values Austin and I decided on when we first founded Unify: \u201cGet your rock done.\u201d\n\u00a0\u00a0\nIt means focusing on the work that actually matters and executing on it consistently.\n\nSo in keeping with our value, instead of using a prop, they sourced an actual one-ton rock from a quarry and brought it into the studio.\n\nI\u2019m incredibly grateful to OpenAI, Arielle, and Caroline for including me and making this such a fun experience.\n\nAlthough it really isn\u2019t about me, this campaign represents the entire Unify team showing up and getting their rocks done every single day.\n\nUnified Team, Unified Dream! \ud83d\ude4c",
