  {
    "type": "post",
    "id": "7402014461353639936",
    "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/austin-t-hughes_pylons-ceo-marty-kausas-was-manually-sending-ugcPost-7402013811592855552-wkYN",
    "content": "Pylon's CEO Marty Kausas was manually sending 40 LinkedIn DMs a day, trying to MacGyver his dream outbound system with Clay. 4 weeks after switching to Unify, they drove $300K in pipeline. Here's their playbook:\n\u00a0\nWhen I first talked with Marty about Pylon's warm outbound motion, he was doing what most early-stage founders do: grinding through manual outreach and trying to automate it with Clay tables, Zaps, and enrichment tools. He was exhausted and knew this approach wouldn't scale.\n\u00a0\nAs I described Unify, he immediately recognized it as the exact system he'd been trying to piece together for months.\n\u00a0\nHis response: \"Take my money as quickly as possible.\"\n\u00a0\nPylon quickly consolidated everything into Unify. And within 2 weeks of onboarding, they launched 10 automated Plays combining CRM data, website intent, and tech stack signals.\n\u00a0\nAfter only a few weeks running these plays, they generated $300K in net new pipeline. A few months later, they achieved 4.2X ROI.\n\u00a0\nNow Pylon uses Unify for their entire GTM motion, including automated outbound to ICP prospects, real-time Slack notifications when qualified visitors hit their pricing page, and round-robin alerts to SDRs. They've influenced close to $3M in pipeline this way.\n\u00a0\nAs Marty puts it: \"This is our go-to-market operating system, and one that every company should invest in.\"\n\u00a0\nIf you want to learn more, I'll drop a link in the comments to book time with our team.",
